{
  "schema": 2,
  "version": "draft-2026.1",
  "_status": "DRAFT FOR CLINICAL REVIEW - NOT APPROVED, NOT IN USE.",
  "_what_this_is": "A first draft of real routing content, written so that a clinician edits and signs rather than authoring from a blank file. It is NOT clinically reviewed and must not be served to patients until it is. The version deliberately says 'draft', so pointing the gate at it requires somebody to type the word 'draft' into a production setting - which is the moment they should stop.",
  "_what_a_reviewer_must_do": [
    "1. Check every red-flag phrase. These are the only thing standing between a patient with a danger sign and a list of possibilities. Missing one is the worst failure this file can have.",
    "2. Check every condition's weights. They encode 'this symptom makes this condition more likely, by this much'. They are a clinician's judgement, not a measurement, and the current numbers are a starting point for argument.",
    "3. Check every service mapping. A condition routed to the wrong service sends somebody to the wrong desk.",
    "4. Have the Kinyarwanda and French reviewed by a native speaker. The English was written first and the other two follow it; some phrasing will be literal where it should be idiomatic.",
    "5. Decide what is missing. This covers common presentations only. Anything absent simply does not match, and the patient is told so."
  ],
  "_deliberately_absent": "No condition here names a specific pathogen where a clinical test is what distinguishes it. 'Fever needing assessment' rather than 'malaria', because the app cannot do a blood film and telling somebody they have malaria when they have typhoid is the harm this whole design exists to avoid.",
  "disclaimer": {
    "rw": "Ibi si isuzuma ry'indwara. Bikwereka gusa serivisi ikwiye ko wasura. Niba wumva umeze nabi cyane, jya kwa muganga ako kanya.",
    "en": "This is not a diagnosis. It only suggests which service to attend. If you feel very unwell, go to a health facility now.",
    "fr": "Ceci n'est pas un diagnostic. Il indique seulement quel service consulter. Si votre etat est grave, rendez-vous immediatement dans un centre de sante."
  },
  "emergency_advice": {
    "rw": "Jya ku bitaro byihuse cyangwa uhamagare ubutabazi ako kanya. Ntutegereze.",
    "en": "Go to the nearest emergency department now, or call emergency services. Do not wait.",
    "fr": "Rendez-vous immediatement aux urgences ou appelez les secours. N'attendez pas."
  },
