      "service": "general_consultation",
      "advice": {
        "rw": "Nywa amazi menshi. Niba impiswi zimaze iminsi ibiri, cyangwa hari amaraso, jya kwa muganga.",
        "en": "Drink plenty of fluids. If diarrhoea lasts more than two days, or there is blood, go to a facility.",
        "fr": "Buvez beaucoup. Si la diarrhee dure plus de deux jours, ou s'il y a du sang, consultez."
      }
