        "rw": "Abana barwara vuba. Niba umwana atanywa, asinzira cyane, cyangwa afite umuriro mwinshi, jya kwa muganga ako kanya.",
        "en": "Children deteriorate quickly. If a child will not drink, is very sleepy, or has a high fever, go now.",
        "fr": "Les enfants se degradent vite. S'il ne boit pas, est tres somnolent ou a une forte fievre, allez-y tout de suite."
      },
      "requires": [
        "sym_child"
      ],
      "_note": "`requires` gates this entirely on a child being involved. Without it the small fever and diarrhoea weights - there so a feverish child ranks higher - leaked onto every adult with a fever, who was then shown a paediatric suggestion."
